            "Despite pressure from his own party, Adams avoided a full war with France and secured a peaceful settlement — a decision he was proudest of."),
        q("a14", "adams", "What controversial 1798 laws, signed by Adams, restricted immigrants' rights and made it a crime to criticize the government?",
